- op: discuss  # 89ac
  at: '2026-07-31T20:34:15Z'  # 89ac
  by: agent  # 89ac
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 89ac
  clock: 6  # 89ac
  nonce: 89ac  # 89ac
  message: "PARKED pending a ruling on the UsageContext semantics stretch. Not workable as filed: the matcher already HAS a call surface (UsagePatternSpec, shipped 2026-01-30, four months before filing); the producers emit UsageContext only for enumerated framework call names, and ADR-3ccc models a symbol appearing INSIDE a framework call, not one BOUND TO its result. Multi-session and ADR-touching: rule the semantics, amend ADR-3ccc with a fifth pattern category, build a parity gate, then a chokepoint across nine producers. P1 severity and consequence unchanged; only the size estimate and the module were wrong. Two measurement notes on the record above."  # 89ac
